        // Grant the role to the account via the reference contract's public interface.
        // The default admin of the role in the constructor-setup is TIMELOCK_ADMIN_ROLE for PROPOSER/EXECUTOR,
        // but we need an admin that can grant arbitrary roles. Since the contract deployed in setUp() has
